      <description><![CDATA[<p>Renaming no longer drops out on its own: if a folder reloaded while you were renaming something in it (on a NAS, often a transfer finishing into it), the list could re-sort and end the rename before you could type. The list now holds still while a name is being edited, and catches up once you press Return or Escape.</p>]]></description>
